:: Fishing Pier Clothing Catch
<<effects>>
<<if $daily.fishing.fishingPier.whitney.phase is "bet">>
	<<fishingPierClothingCaughtWhitneyBet>>
<<elseif $daily.fishing.fishingPier.fisher.phase is "fishing">>
	<<fishingPierClothingCaughtFisher>>
<<else>>
	<<fishingPierClothingCaught>>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Pier Clothing Toss
<<effects>>
You carry the sodden <<= $fishingClothingName>> over to a bin on the pier and throw it away.
<<unset $fishingClothingName>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Clothing Keep
<<effects>>
<<set _clothingResult to fishingFindClothingItem($fishingClothingName)>>
<<generalSend "wardrobe" _clothingResult.slot $fishingClothingName _clothingResult.colour>>
You wring it out and stow it away.
<<unset $fishingClothingName>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Widgets Fishing Pier Clothing Catch [widget]
<<widget "fishingPierClothingCaught">>
	<<fishingClothingCatchText>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Keep it|Fishing Pier Clothing Keep]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Toss it aside|Fishing Pier Clothing Toss]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "fishingPierClothingCaughtFisher">>
	<<fishingClothingCatchText>>
	<br><br>

	<<if $rng lt 50>>
		<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
		<<switch random(1, 2)>>
			<<case 1>>
				"More junk than fish in there some days," the <<personsimple>> says, glancing at your catch.
			<<case 2>>
				The <<personsimple>> shakes <<his>> head. "People'll throw their rubbish anywhere. No respect for the place."
		<</switch>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<link [[Keep it|Fishing Pier Clothing Keep]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Toss it aside|Fishing Pier Clothing Toss]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "fishingPierClothingCaughtWhitneyBet">>
	<<fishingClothingCatchText>>
	<<unset $fishingClothingName>>
	<br><br>

	<<fishingPierWhitneyBetNonFish>>
<</widget>>
